L160: Acknowledgments
L161: The authors’ responsibilities were as follows—AAW: developed the research question under discussion with LNL and RPGH, organized data collection with RNL, and was responsible for the final content; RPGH: devised and conducted the data analyses; LNL: drafted the manuscript after data interpretation in conjunction with RPGH and AAW who also edited the manuscript; AAM and AAW: were involved in nutritional database and dietary assessment development; K-TK: was the principal investigator of the EPIC-Norfolk study; and all authors: read and approved the final manuscript. The EPIC datasets used in our analyses are available to other researchers by request to the EPIC team at the University of Cambridge.
